\e[2J\e[16;1H   This illustrates the "wrap around bug" which exists on a\r\r\n
   standard VT100. At the top of the screen there should be\r\r\n
   a row of +'s, and the rightmost column should be filled\r\r\n
   with *'s. But if the bug is present, some of the *'s may\r\r\n
   be placed in other places, e.g. in the leftmost column,\r\r\n
   and the top line of +'s may be scrolled away.\r\r\n
\e[1;1H+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\e[1;80f*\e[2;80f*
